Hi Elke,

the matrix you are trying to create has 5^21 = 476837158203125 rows and 21 columns. I'm afraid Thierry's proposal with n=21 will not fit into memory. And the file you are writing is 5^21*5*8 bytes big, about 80108643 GB.

Perhaps you want to think a little more about what you are trying to achieve and, e.g., consider random sampling from the matrix?

In addition, look at your code: you append every single line to the output file, i.e., you open and close your file 5^21 = 476837158203125 times. File I/O always takes a lot of time. File I/O in a loop usually leads to slow execution.

HTH,
Stephan



